The [[Hammer]] is a [[Weapon]] available in the shop for all characters, at rare rarity. It has no crafting options, other than its ability to break open a [[Piggybank]] for a [[Bunch of Coins]], which only has the purpose of selling for 5 {{icon/gold}}. The [[Hammer]] deals relatively high DPS for a non-crafted weapon at rare rarity, although it is also one of the few [[Weapon]]s in the game which uses over 1 stamina per second, at 1.5 stamina per second. After about three attacks, without some kind of help (like maybe backpack [[Topaz]]es), the [[Hammer]] will start to skip attacks. The [[Hammer]] has a chance to [[Stun]], which is an unusual trait, and opens up some build opportunities, since [[Dagger]]s attack an extra time whenever the opponent is stunned.
